coverages were correlated positively (r = 0.68)\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"estimated the cumulative proportion of persons vaccinated with at least 1 dose during August--January by using the Kaplan-Meier survival analysis procedure\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"CDC performed Pearson correlations among children and adults to determine if state-specific seasonal coverage was associated with state-specific H1N1 coverage\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Student t-tests were used to determine statistical difference between groups.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Combined estimates were weighted averages of the BRFSS and NHFS estimates, with weights being determined by the effective sample sizes.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Superscripted letters indicate that the value was significantly different (p<0.05) than the value for another race/ethnic group\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Estimates might be unreliable because confidence interval half-width is >10\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\", \"study_design\", \"outcome_types\"]}", "type": "text"}]}